TITLE Equilibrate pure water with fixed-pressure gas mixture at 150C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 10
    CO2(g) 10
    NH3(g) 5

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.tsv
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -alkalinity true
END
